🚨 REQUEST TO MEDIA & JOURNALISTS — PLEASE INVESTIGATE

This matter has remained unresolved for TWO MONTHS.

In brief: I pledged approximately 80 grams of gold comprising 4 ornaments with IIFL Finance, Naroda, Ahmedabad, in October 2022. On 8 August 2026, I went to recover my gold and was told the loan had allegedly been closed in April/May 2023. I dispute the closure and deny collecting my gold. The document shown to me does not bear my signature and appears to show only 1 ornament instead of 4. I was told the closure involved OTP, but I have not received satisfactory proof that I authorized the closure or received my jewellery.

A police application has been submitted at Naroda Police Station, and Gujarat Police responded to my post on 8 August. However, two months later, I still have no clear investigation status, findings, action taken or expected timeline. I have also received no satisfactory resolution from IIFL Finance.

I am requesting responsible journalists and media organisations in Gujarat and across India to examine the documents, question IIFL Finance and the concerned authorities, and help establish what happened to my pledged gold.

